<p>Two patterns: the Claude Code LSP plugins don't install in Grok Build, and a few names (auth0, grafana-mcp, postman, pr-review-toolkit) now exist in more than one marketplace, so Grok asks you to pin one with <code>name@marketplace</code>.</p>
